      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Ned Kock, Ph.D.",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 40.828186,
          "r": 141.95001,
          "b": 45.359985,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "COURSE DESCRIPTION",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 83.31526,
          "r": 235.43312,
          "b": 89.900024,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "This is a project-centered course in which students apply and integrate conceptual and",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 101.82199,
          "r": 517.69,
          "b": 107.17999,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "technical knowledge acquired during their program of studies, as well as new applied",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 115.52598,
          "r": 505.888,
          "b": 120.97998,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "knowledge that they will acquire during this course. This is achieved through a comprehensive",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 129.32603,
          "r": 529.46606,
          "b": 134.78003,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "hands-on project. Students are expected to complete a team project that is creative and likely to",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 143.12602,
          "r": 531.95605,
          "b": 148.58002,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "be successful in the “real world”. Each team must have a client to whom the project will provide",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 156.80602,
          "r": 538.09406,
          "b": 162.26001,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "real world value. This client will typically be an organization.",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 170.606,
          "r": 371.35,
          "b": 176.06,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "COURSE OBJECTIVES",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 210.99525,
          "r": 228.47313,
          "b": 217.58002,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "The main objectives of this course are to give students opportunities to apply and integrate",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 229.40599,
          "r": 509.482,
          "b": 234.85999,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "conceptual and technical knowledge acquired during their program of studies. The particular",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 243.23601,
          "r": 519.48395,
          "b": 248.69,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "focus in this course is on data mining, business analytics, as well as data visualization and",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 257.03598,
          "r": 506.44403,
          "b": 262.49,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "analysis methods relevant to current business decision making.",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 270.83597,
          "r": 376.99,
          "b": 276.28998,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "LEARNING OBJECTIVES",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 311.22525,
          "r": 241.55312,
          "b": 317.81,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "This is a very “intense” course, where constant exchanges of ideas among students, instructor,",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 329.516,
          "r": 526.824,
          "b": 334.97,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "and outside constituents are encouraged. Critical thinking and the ability of conduct research",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 343.31598,
          "r": 538.45404,
          "b": 348.77,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "with a certain degree of independence are a must for success in this course. At the end of this",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 357.116,
          "r": 533.13806,
          "b": 362.57,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "course, students should be able to:",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 370.916,
          "r": 239.81,
          "b": 376.37,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "• Integrate disparate bodies of knowledge into a single project.",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 385.38202,
          "r": 386.11,
          "b": 391.01,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "• Compile and analyze organizational data to inform high-level decision making in a single",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 400.022,
          "r": 523.04803,
          "b": 405.65,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "integrated project.",
          "l": 90.024,
          "t": 414.016,
          "r": 180.26,
          "b": 419.47,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "• Conduct checks for data measurement validity, reliability and collinearity in a single",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 428.482,
          "r": 498.89798,
          "b": 434.11,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "integrated project.",
          "l": 90.024,
          "t": 442.456,
          "r": 180.26,
          "b": 447.91,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "• Understand and explain, to organizational stakeholders, patterns in plots with standardized",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 456.922,
          "r": 527.4341,
          "b": 462.55,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "and unstandardized data, in a single integrated project.",
          "l": 90.024,
          "t": 470.896,
          "r": 354.67,
          "b": 476.35,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "• Make use of legends and labels to clarify patterns among variables, in a single integrated",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 485.362,
          "r": 519.202,
          "b": 490.99,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "project.",
          "l": 90.024,
          "t": 499.336,
          "r": 129.38,
          "b": 504.79,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "• Identify predictors and criteria variables to be included in causal models for the analysis of",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 513.802,
          "r": 528.75604,
          "b": 519.43,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "organizational data, in a single integrated project.",
          "l": 90.024,
          "t": 527.896,
          "r": 330.31,
          "b": 533.35,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "• Include, interpret, and explain to organizational stakeholders the following types of effects",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 542.362,
          "r": 527.5321,
          "b": 547.99,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "among variables: direct, indirect, total, and moderating effects, in a single integrated project.",
          "l": 90.024,
          "t": 556.336,
          "r": 537.22,
          "b": 561.79,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "• Visualize and interpret data distribution patterns based on two-dimensional, three-",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 570.802,
          "r": 484.576,
          "b": 576.43,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "dimensional, and multi-dimensional graphs, in a single integrated project.",
          "l": 90.024,
          "t": 584.806,
          "r": 446.71,
          "b": 590.26,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "TEXTBOOK",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 625.19525,
          "r": 153.68312,
          "b": 631.78,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "The document below describes and illustrates the technique of model-driven data analytics",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 643.486,
          "r": 510.58,
          "b": 648.94,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "(MDDA), which involves the creation of a path model expressing an applied theory, and testing",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 657.286,
          "r": 534.86,
          "b": 662.74,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "the model using path analysis with latent variables. The latter, path analysis with latent variables,",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 671.086,
          "r": 541.03204,
          "b": 676.54,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "MIS 5390 Syllabus, Page 2",
          "l": 431.47,
          "t": 708.0042,
          "r": 542.58997,
          "b": 712.536,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        }
      ]
