          "b": 45.359985,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "is generally known as structural equation modeling. This document will be provided online, and",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 82.52598,
          "r": 535.85803,
          "b": 87.97998,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "free of charge, by the instructor.",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 96.32603,
          "r": 229.37,
          "b": 101.78003,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "• Model-driven data analytics: Applications with WarpPLS, by Ned Kock. Publisher:",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 124.59197,
          "r": 494.81802,
          "b": 130.21997,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "ScriptWarp Systems.",
          "l": 90.024,
          "t": 138.68602,
          "r": 194.33,
          "b": 144.14001,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "MDDA emerged from the work of a special category of users of the software WarpPLS – data",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 166.166,
          "r": 527.524,
          "b": 171.62,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "analysis consultants, who regularly work with organizations to provide data-driven",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 179.96599,
          "r": 472.87,
          "b": 185.41998,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "recommendations.",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 193.76598,
          "r": 163.34,
          "b": 199.21997,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "While MDDA can be implemented through a variety of software tools, it has found wide",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 221.36601,
          "r": 501.192,
          "b": 226.82,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "adoption among WarpPLS users, because of the many powerful features of this software that can",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 235.166,
          "r": 540.38403,
          "b": 240.62,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "be used in this context. Moreover, in WarpPLS all analyses are model-driven, which makes this",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 248.99602,
          "r": 534.514,
          "b": 254.45001,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "software much more user-friendly than other software tools that rely on extensive scripting to",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 262.796,
          "r": 523.99396,
          "b": 268.25,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "conduct analyses.",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 276.59598,
          "r": 159.62,
          "b": 282.05,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "SOFTWARE MANUAL",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 316.98526,
          "r": 219.83311,
          "b": 323.57,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "The document below is a comprehensive manual for the software system that will be used to",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 335.396,
          "r": 519.02405,
          "b": 340.85,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "demonstrate the concepts and techniques covered in this course. It will be provided online, and",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 349.19598,
          "r": 530.064,
          "b": 354.65,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "free of charge, by the instructor.",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 362.996,
          "r": 229.37,
          "b": 368.45,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "• WarpPLS 8.0 User Manual, by Ned Kock. Publisher: ScriptWarp Systems.",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 391.26202,
          "r": 453.46,
          "b": 396.89,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "This manual actually contains a relatively comprehensive discussion of concepts and methods",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 419.056,
          "r": 525.79205,
          "b": 424.51,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "employed in multivariate statistical analysis techniques in general, particularly the technique",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 432.856,
          "r": 518.94,
          "b": 438.31,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "known as structural equation modeling. This is one of the most sophisticated types of data",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 446.65598,
          "r": 507.254,
          "b": 452.11,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "analysis techniques used in business. The various data analysis techniques discussed in this",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 460.456,
          "r": 512.618,
          "b": 465.91,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "course can be conceptually seen as special cases of structural equation modeling.",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 474.25598,
          "r": 463.54,
          "b": 479.71,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "STUDENT TEAMS",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 514.6452,
          "r": 194.99312,
          "b": 521.23,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "Students must contact other prospective team members of their choice, create teams, and",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 532.93604,
          "r": 512.998,
          "b": 538.39,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "define a team leader. Teams should have between 3 and 7 student members. Each team",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 546.736,
          "r": 512.266,
          "b": 552.19,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "leader must inform the instructor and the rest of the class (through a post on the course’s",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 560.632,
          "r": 530.98004,
          "b": 565.99,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "Module 1 discussion board) about the creation of their team. This should be done by 1 PM",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 574.432,
          "r": 535.94,
          "b": 579.79,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "on Friday in the second week of the course. (See the appendix with the course schedule at",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 588.262,
          "r": 529.85,
          "b": 593.62,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "the end of this document.)",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 602.062,
          "r": 208.13,
          "b": 607.42,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "Team leaders should provide the full names, short bios (one paragraph on education and",
          "l": 72.024,
          "t": 629.56604,
          "r": 517.814,
          "b": 635.02,
          "origin": "PdfTextLayer"
        },
        {
          "text": "work background is enough), and full contact information for each of the team members.",
